<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Est up on bullish land auction.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Est up on bullish land auction.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of major Japanese property firm Mitsubishi Estate Co Ltd climbed on Friday morning, helped by the bullish auction of prime land in Tokyo previously owned by the now-defunct national railways, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price had risen 50 yen or 3.68 percent to 1,410 yen by 0120 GMT, making it the eighth largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The volume was 1.505 million shares.</p>
</text>
